    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18551" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφυβρίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>work off youthful passion, sow one's wild oats,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Men.
				377
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of wine,
				<i>to be done fermenting,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				45.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>give a loose rein</i> to passion, <i>indulge freely,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τρυφάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Demetr.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔς τινα</span>
			<i>vent</i> upon . . , <i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				1.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.19
			</span></i>.</div>
